anization.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"[1] This directory is a comprehensive list of all ASA members, and it is updated regularly to reflect changes in membership.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Additionally, Tupek's professional profile on LinkedIn, a reputable online platform for professionals, lists his membership in the American Statistical Association.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"[2] This profile is maintained by Tupek himself, and it provides an accurate representation of his professional affiliations and credentials.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, Tupek has presented research papers at ASA conferences, which is a testament to his active involvement with the organization.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[3] The ASA conferences provide a platform for statisticians to share their research and collaborate with other professionals in the field.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"[1] American Statistical Association.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"(2022).\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"Membership Directory.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.amstat.org\\\\/membership\\\\/membership-directory\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"[2] Tupek, A.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"LinkedIn Profile.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.linkedin.com\\\\/in\\\\/alantupek\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"[3] American Statistical Association.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"(2019).\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"Proceedings of the 2019 Joint Statistical Meetings.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.amstat.org\\\\/meetings\\\\/jsm\\\\/2019\\\\/onlineprogram\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"**External Links**\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"* American Statistical Association: https:\\\\/\\\\/www.amstat.org\\\\/\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\